### What document types are supported? {#what-document-types-are-supported}

The Document AI OCR processor supports the following document and image formats:
| Documents                          | Images               |
|------------------------------------|----------------------|
| **PDF** (.pdf)                     | **JPEG** (.jpg, .jpeg)|
| **Word Documents** (.docx, .doc)   | **PNG** (.png)       |
| **PowerPoint** (.pptx, .ppt)       | **AVIF** (.avif)     |
| **Excel** (.xlsx, .csv)                | **TIFF** (.tiff)     |
| **Text Files** (.txt)              | **GIF** (.gif)       |
| **EPUB** (.epub)                   | **HEIC/HEIF** (.heic, .heif)|
| **XML/DocBook** (.xml)             | **BMP** (.bmp)       |
| **RTF** (.rtf)                     | **WebP** (.webp)     |
| **OpenDocument Text** (.odt)       |                      |
| **BibTeX/BibLaTeX** (.bib)         |                      |
| **FictionBook** (.fb2)             |                      |
| **Jupyter Notebooks** (.ipynb)     |                      |
| **JATS XML** (.xml)                |                      |
| **LaTeX** (.tex)                   |                      |
| **OPML** (.opml)                   |                      |
| **Troff** (.1, .man)               |                      |

