QUESTION
How do I put `document_annotation_format` into a batch OCR request file?

REFERENCE ANSWER
Each line of the batch `.jsonl` is `{"custom_id": ..., "body": {...}}` and the body is the same payload the OCR endpoint takes, so `document_annotation_format` goes inside `body`.
`bbox_annotation_format` goes in the same place; both carry the usual `type: json_schema` wrapper.

GOLD SOURCES
https://docs.mistral.ai/studio/batch-processing

ANSWER UNDER TEST
To include `document_annotation_format` in a batch OCR request file, structure your JSON object as follows:

1. Place `document_annotation_format` directly under the `body` key, alongside other fields like `document` and optionally `bbox_annotation_format` or `pages`.

2. The format must follow the `json_schema` type, specifying:
   - A `name` (e.g., `document_annotation`).
   - A `schema` defining the required properties for the document annotation (e.g., `language`, `urls`).
   - A `strict` flag (typically `true`).

Here is an example of how to include it in a batch request:

```json
{
  "custom_id": "1",
  "body": {
    "document": {
      "document_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mistralai/cookbook/refs/heads/main/mistral/ocr/receipt.png"
    },
    "document_annotation_format": {
      "type": "json_schema",
      "json_schema": {
        "schema": {
          "properties": {
            "language": {"title": "Language", "type": "string"},
            "urls": {"title": "urls", "type": "string"}
          },
          "required": ["language", "urls"],
          "title": "DocumentAnnotation",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "name": "document_annotation",
        "strict": true
      }
    }
  }
}
```

This example is derived from the batch processing documentation for OCR requests [1].

For reference, the `document_annotation_format` can also be combined with `bbox_annotation_format` and `pages` as shown in the following example:

```json
{
  "custom_id": "2",
  "body": {
    "document": {
      "image_url": "data:image/jpeg;base64,<base64_image>"
    },
    "bbox_annotation_format": {
      "type": "json_schema",
      "json_schema": {
        "schema": {
          "properties": {
            "document_type": {"title": "Document_Type", "type": "string"},
            "short_description": {"title": "Short_Description", "type": "string"},
            "summary": {"title": "Summary", "type": "string"}
          },
          "required": ["document_type", "short_description", "summary"],
          "title": "BBOXAnnotation",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "name": "document_annotation",
        "strict": true
      }
    },
    "document_annotation_format": {
      "type": "json_schema",
      "json_schema": {
        "schema": {
          "properties": {
            "language": {"title": "Language", "type": "string"},
            "urls": {"title": "urls", "type": "string"}
          },
          "required": ["language", "urls"],
          "title": "DocumentAnnotation",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "name": "document_annotation",
        "strict": true
