If used in the example above, this technique would ensure that the model's responses are consistent in terms of formating and also allows to enforce the categories to be used.
If you are interested, for more details on how to use structured outputs, you can refer to the [Structured Outputs](https://docs.mistral.ai/studio/conversations/structured-output) docs.



